      en: ["The Battle of São Mamede, won by Afonso Henriques in 1128, took place nearby.", "The Palace of the Dukes of Braganza features 39 distinctive brick chimneys.", "Guimarães was the European Capital of Culture in the year 2012.", "The castle of Guimarães was built in the 10th century to protect against Vikings.", "The Church of Nossa Senhora da Oliveira was founded in the 10th century.", "Much of the old town wall, built in the 14th century, is still standing."],
      es: ["Lugar de nacimiento del primer rey Alfonso Henriques.", "Estatus de Patrimonio de la Humanidad de la UNESCO desde 2001.", "Posee un castillo del siglo X muy bien conservado.", "Conocida por el Palacio de los Duques de Braganza.", "Lema de la ciudad: Aquí nació Portugal.", "Centro con arquitectura típica de piedra y madera."],
      pt: ["Local de nascimento do primeiro rei, D. Afonso Henriques.", "Estatuto de Património Mundial da UNESCO desde o ano de 2001.", "Possui um castelo do século X bem conservado.", "Conhecida pelo Paço dos Duques de Bragança.", "Lema da cidade: Aqui nasceu Portugal.", "Centro com arquitetura típica de pedra e madeira."],
      fr: ["Lieu de naissance du premier roi Alfonso Henriques.", "Statut de patrimoine mondial de l'UNESCO depuis 2001.", "Possède un château du Xe siècle bien conservé.", "Connue pour le palais des ducs de Bragance.", "Devise de la ville : Ici est né le Portugal.", "Centre avec une architecture typique en pierre et en bois."],
