      en: ["Highest peak reaches 666 meters above sea level.", "The Real Fábrica do Gelo was constructed in 1741.", "The mountain range spans a length of 15 kilometers.", "It is home to more than 400 distinct plant species.", "Protected Landscape status was established in 1999.", "The range is located 65 km away from Lisbon."],
