      en: ["The construction of the sanctuary took a total of 55 years.", "The rose windows are the largest in all of Portugal.", "The design was created by the architect Miguel Ventura Terra.", "The funicular was inaugurated in the year 1923.", "The sanctuary is dedicated to Saint Lucy.", "The mosaics inside were crafted by Italian artists."],
